==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*20 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Divine Cyclone]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kappy Jr.]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Medu-san]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**10 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns.
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns.
**2 [[Divine Cyclone]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**8 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

